{"blocks": [{"type": "paragraph", "text": "本日 6/10 （水）"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "櫻坂46 15thシングル発売です！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "今作もこうして皆さんの元へ届けられることが"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "とても嬉しいです"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "一緒に楽しみましょう！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "よろしくお願いします ୨୧"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202606/mobQ5r8im.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "What’s \"KAZOKU\"?"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "ミュージックビデオ"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "見ていただけましたか？"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "不思議で可愛い世界観"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "撮影の時から完成が楽しみで"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "ワクワクしていました"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "櫻坂を家族と捉えたコンセプトも素敵です"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "櫻坂の表題曲では割と珍しい"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "明るくてキャッチーな曲"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "かつ"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "『夜桜さんちの大作戦』"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "のオープニングテーマを務めさせていただくということもあり"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "より多くの方に"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "櫻坂46を知っていただけるきっかけになれば嬉しいなと思っています"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "一緒に広めていきたいです"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "たくさんの方に届けましょう .·*"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "1サビの KAZOKU の手振りは"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "みんなにも真似してやってみてほしいな"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "なんて思っています"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "手振りの最後の指差しは"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "KAZOKU の U （you）です"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "気づいてた？ 𖠶𖠶"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "通常速度だと"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "速くてむずかしいですが"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "ゆっくりならきっとできます…！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "ぜひ"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "TikTok等で"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "ゆっくりテンポでやってみてください  ^ ^"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "後日、私のInstagramに動画載せます〜"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "あと"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "メンバーの可愛いところもいっぱい撮ったので"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "少しずつ載せます *"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202606/mob43A2qE.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "❤︎❤︎"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "ミュージックビデオ撮影は"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "メンバーみんなわちゃわちゃ賑やかで"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "休憩時間も"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "ギューっとなっていたり"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "愛おしい瞬間がたくさんでした"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "そんな姿を見ていたら"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "メンバーが本当に家族のように見えてきて"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "なんだかほっこりしました"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202606/mob3V7LPF.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "名前がついた 「ミミ」です 🐈‍⬛❤︎"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "ミュージックビデオの好きなシーン"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "抜粋したいけれど"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "全部好きで困ります"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "1つあげると"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "ラストのポーズ前"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "天さんと目を合わせるところ"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "嬉しくて"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "つい素の笑顔になっちゃいます"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "いつも可愛すぎます"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "腕組みポーズは"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "私がポーズに迷っていたら"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "一緒にやろー！"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "と誘ってくださりました"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "優しいです 🤦🏻‍♀️"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "ちなみに後付けで"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "天さんがお父さんで私が娘という設定です（笑）"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "こんなふうに"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "曲の1番最初と最後の"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "家族写真をイメージしたポーズは"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "もしメンバーで1つの家族だったら"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "自分はどんな役割かな？"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "というのも含めて"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "みんなで考えました"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "それも新鮮で楽しかったです ( ◜ᴗ◝ )"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "あと"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "写真のポーズ"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "逆再生になってるの"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "気づきましたか？"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "振付、見どころがたくさんです"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "私は"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "振り入れの時からずっと"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "自然と楽しんで踊っていました ^ ^"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202606/mobhmanWO.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "シンメのりかちゃん"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "「ただいま」も「おかえり」も無意識に"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "の歌詞のところが好きです"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "あと"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "いつも目が合うところがあって"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "2人で笑ってます ^ ^"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "今後探してみてね"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202606/mobAt173h.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202606/mobhauC47.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "CDTVライブ！ライブ！"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "ではフルサイズで初披露させていただきました"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "ありがとうございました ︎ ︎✧︎"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "ミュージックビデオが公開される前"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "初めてのパフォーマンス披露だったので"